# authz/

Authorization and permission enforcement for gRPC services. Handles JWT claims validation, permission checking via glob pattern matching, and service-level authorization wrappers for EntryService and IndexService.

## Files

- `mod.rs` -- Module exports and Error enum for authorization failures
- `claims.rs` -- JWT Claims struct with registered and custom claim fields, plus custom validation logic
- `permissions.rs` -- Permissable trait definition, permission validation regex, and is_permitted authorization check function
- `glob.rs` -- High-performance glob pattern matching with DP memoization for URN-style permission strings
- `entry.rs` -- EntryServiceAuthorizor wrapper that checks permissions before delegating to inner service
- `index.rs` -- IndexServiceAuthorizor wrapper that checks permissions before delegating to inner service
